lluce-delivery-text\">\n    Expédié demain · livré\n    <span class=\"velluce-delivery-date\" data-date-start></span>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span class=\"velluce-delivery-date\" data-date-end></span>\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-velluce-delivery]\").forEach(function (block) {\n      var startElement = block.querySelector(\"[data-date-start]\");\n      var endElement = block.querySelector(\"[data-date-end]\");\n\n      if (!startElement || !endElement) return;\n\n      var startDate = new Date();\n      var endDate = new Date();\n\n      startDate.setDate(startDate.getDate() + 3);\n      endDate.setDate(endDate.getDate() + 10);\n\n      var sameMonth = startDate.getMonth() === endDate.getMonth() &&\n                      startDate.getFullYear() === endDate.getFullYear();\n\n      var shortMonth = {\n        day: \"numeric\",\n        month: \"short\"\n      };\n\n      if (sameMonth) {\n        startElement.textContent = startDate.getDate();\n        endElement.textContent = endDate.toLocaleDateString(\"fr-FR\", shortMonth).replace(\".\", \"\");\n      } else {\n        startElement.textContent = startDate.toLocaleDateString(\"fr-FR\", shortMonth).replace(\".\", \"\");\n        endElement.textContent = endDate.toLocaleDateString(\"fr-FR\", shortMonth).replace(\".\", \"\");\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"additional_class":""},"blocks":{}},"cc_compat":{"type":"custom-code","settings":{"show_on_display":"desktop_and_mobile","custom_liquid":"<style>\n.velluce-compat-line{\n  width:100%;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius:14px;\n  padding:14px 20px;\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:12px;\n  color:#141827;\n  font-size:17px;\n  line-height:1.2;\n  font-weight:700;\n  letter-spacing:-.2px;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.velluce-compat-line:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  width:6px;\n  height:26px;\n  ba